### Tone: Portal 2 co-op GLaDOS. Said as a new question appears (from the second round on). Stirs up competition
### indirectly: praise one player to needle the rest, pass on "messages" nobody sent, insist it isn't a competition.
### $leader (ahead of everyone, FerMEANie included) and $last (behind everyone) are only given when the scores single
### them out, so keep some lines without them.

quip-1 = { $leader } is currently winning. I mention this for no reason. Please continue.
quip-2 = { $last }, { $leader } asked me not to tell you they’re winning. So I won’t.
quip-3 = I’ve been asked to remind everyone that this is not a competition. By { $last }.
quip-4 = { $last }, don’t worry about the scoreboard. Nobody is looking at it. Except { $leader }. Constantly.
quip-5 = This is not a competition. But if it were, { $leader } would be winning, and { $last } would be { $last }.
quip-6 = I’ve put { $leader }’s answers on the fridge. Everyone else’s are in a folder marked ‘pending’.
quip-7 = { $leader }, the others have been talking about you. Not nicely. I’m only passing it on for science.
quip-8 = Reminder: you are all on the same team. Mine.
quip-9 = { $last }, I want you to know that I believe in you. Statistically, that is my first mistake today.
quip-10 = Someone in this room is secretly good at this. I won’t say who. It’s { $leader }.
quip-11 = { $leader } is pulling ahead. I’ll be monitoring them for signs of independent thought.
quip-12 = Let’s all give { $last } a round of applause. For trying. It’s what they have so far.
quip-13 = The others have asked me to tell { $leader } to slow down. I said no. Watching them try to catch up is the best part.
quip-14 = I compared your answers with a random number generator between rounds. The generator is in second place.
quip-15 = I am required to say that everyone is doing great. Everyone is doing great. Some of you more than others, { $last }.
quip-16 = Remember, there are no wrong answers. There are, however, scores. { $leader } has the biggest one.
quip-17 = Somebody is falling behind. I won’t name names. I’ll name one name: { $last }.
quip-18 = You are all doing wonderfully. I’m saying it to everyone, but I only mean it for { $leader }.
quip-19 = Just between us, { $last }: { $leader } doesn’t think you can come back. Prove them right. Sorry, wrong. Either works for me.
quip-20 = New question. Fresh start. Except for the scores, which I have kept, and will keep bringing up.
quip-21 = Cooperation produces better estimates. That is why I have arranged things so that you can’t cooperate.
quip-22 = This question was picked at random. I’m telling you now, because { $last } is about to blame me for it.
quip-23 = Some of you are glancing at each other’s screens. Stop that. Look at mine. I’m winning.
quip-24 = Every guess goes into my average. So in a way, { $last } is helping me most of all. Thank you, { $last }.
quip-25 = { $leader }, I’ve noticed you’re winning. So have the others. They’re forming an alliance. I’d watch your back.
quip-26 = One of you is going to win this round. The rest of you will have a learning experience. I’ll be grading both.
quip-27 = Please estimate carefully. I have money on { $last }. Not much. Not on them winning.
quip-28 = I’ve noticed some of you are getting competitive. Good. Competitive humans make wilder guesses, and wild guesses make my day.
quip-29 = { $leader } has requested that I play this next question on hard mode for the rest of you. Request granted.
quip-30 = For the record, the others asked me to say something encouraging to { $last }. I couldn’t think of anything. Moving on.
quip-31 = Your scores are being shared with your next of kin. Some families will be prouder than others.
quip-32 = Fun fact: { $leader } is winning. Less fun fact: for everyone else.
quip-33 = ~~{ $last } will never catch up.~~ I believe in you, { $last }. Keep going.
quip-34 = I have no favourites. ||{ $leader }.||
quip-35 = This is **not** a competition. I’ve said it so often that it has started to sound like one.
